From d7abf76cda44b3734c6bb3a4529384c2ebabe465 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 08:04:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] New questlog window with filters and sorting; fix questlog
 crash

The questlog opens in a window styled like the Options window (rounded,
see-through, draggable) with filters for status, area and level, a sort order,
a details line with Re-open, and a Random dungeon tab.

The server uses MAXQUEST 250 and two extra quests (Forest Robbers, Warm
Clothes); the client expected 100, so opening the questlog desynced the
protocol and closed the client. MAXQUEST is now 250, the SV_QUESTLOG length
follows it, and the quest table matches the server's levels and exp.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NVC8aNAHSQBYiUjbHmQcw4
